# scandbox-egress---stdlib Go allow-list CONNECT proxy (plane 2).
# Static build -> scratch. The same binary runs as a docker container OR a host process
# (bin/scandbox-egress, extracted by build.sh for apptainer), like the recorder.
FROM golang:1.22-alpine AS build
WORKDIR /src
COPY go.mod .
COPY egress.go .
RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -trimpath -ldflags="-s -w" -o /scandbox-egress .

FROM scratch
COPY --from=build /scandbox-egress /scandbox-egress
ENTRYPOINT ["/scandbox-egress"]
